    "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(memhub): restore the one-click log export entry in settings by @kristinhe1111 in https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/pull/38\n* Revise README for clarity and installation instructions by @kristinhe1111 in https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/pull/43\n* release: merge MemHub 1.0.4 development fixes by @txfei in https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/pull/50\n* chore(release): bump MemHub build number to 13 by @kristinhe1111 in https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/pull/52\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/compare/v1.0.3...v1.0.4",
